    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d571-a1">

                <pb facs="1011" n="951" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg951"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caracas,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 4, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister of foreign affairs of the United States of Venezuela salutes
                    attentively the commercial agent in charge of the legation of the United States
                    of America, and has the honor to inform him that to-morrow is the national
                    holiday on account of the anniversary of the independence of Venezuela, and that
                    the executive will receive at 11 o’clock a. m., at the government house.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Erastus C. Pruyn,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Commercial Agent in charge of the Legation of the
                            United States,</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
